      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "It is worth noting that it is already possible to do this by opening up the debug inspector and manually typing the object's name into the SpawnObject event's string parameter and then adding the world object to the VRC_SceneDescriptor's Dynamically Spawned Prefabs list. The spawned clone can then be enabled using the OnSpawn event. However, this is a bit of a hack, so it would be nice to have this feature formally supported by the sdk.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5ad209c49d0ead21cbad37ec",
      "author": {
        "_id": "58c62e995865713647a7115b",
        "alias": "Electric Orca",
        "aliasID": "65c26da3ed6eefce4c4d090a",
