      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "Are unity prefabs able to reference game objects in a specific scene?  I don't think they are. I believe this is the paradigm we are working from. \n\nHowever, sounds like you are able to get around this entirely using the explained technique. We will have to investigate further.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
